cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Laboratory GHS Pictogram & Mixture Label Studio"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Alagesan"
    given-names: "Kathirvel"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kathiralagesan/GHS_Label"
url: "https://kathiralagesan.github.io/GHS_Label/"
abstract: >-
  A 100% client-side, zero-backend web application and Python CLI tool for
  generating Globally Harmonized System (GHS) / EU CLP Regulation (EC) No
  1272/2008 chemical safety labels for laboratory buffers, mobile phases, and
  custom multi-component mixtures, featuring 38 inbuilt presets, optional live
  NCBI PubChem CAS lookup (with an Offline Mode toggle), calibrated physical
  label sizing, anti-clip A4 pagination, and 300-DPI PDF export.
keywords:
  - GHS
  - EU CLP
  - chemical safety
  - laboratory labels
  - proteomics
  - LC-MS
  - SVG
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
